# Dev A works on Windows; the VPS is Linux. Anything the VPS executes or sources
# must keep LF endings, or bash sees a trailing \r and fails in confusing ways
# (a real bug we hit: a CRLF .env made curl report "Malformed input to a URL").
*.sh        text eol=lf
*.env       text eol=lf
.env.example text eol=lf
ecosystem.config.js text eol=lf
